    dcterms:identifier "2025/327/EU" ;
    rdfs:comment "European Health Data Space. Governs primary use (MyHealth@EU, Art.23) and secondary use (HealthData@EU, Art.75) of health data for research, innovation and AI training. Adopted 11 February 2025, published in the OJ on 5 March 2025, in force 26 March 2025; most secondary-use obligations apply from 26 March 2029, with genetic and clinical-trial data from 26 March 2031. All article references were renumbered in v5.1.0 from COM(2022) 197 proposal numbering to the published text."@en ;
    mailo:coversArticle mailo:EHDS_Art68,
